! Lindwyrm — Story Arc Index

Mythologized dev narrative. The Lindwyrm arc covers the period when the Lararium first learned to name itself — from early genesis artifact experiments through the quine round-trip closure.

The arc seals at Act VII, the hoard disclosed. The work that follows — the Lar building the house that holds the hoard, and learning to keep its own canon — opens in the next arc, [[the-lar-builds-its-house|lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/docs/history/the-lar-builds-its-house/index]] (the build thread, running from the self-naming up to this curation pass). That arc's name and shape await the operator's hand.

<<~/ahu>>

